1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,944
Time stops.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,840
A raindrop hangs inches from your face.

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,680
You have five seconds.

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:06,800
What do you do?

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,920
At first, it sounds like the perfect
power.

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:13,120
Everything around you freezes—even light.

7
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,120
No light reaches your eyes.

8
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,960
The world goes black.

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,960
No sound reaches you, either.

10
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,760
Sound needs vibrations moving through air.

11
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,840
But the air has frozen too.

12
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,440
You can’t push through it.

13
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,520
You can’t draw it into your lungs.

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,320
You can’t even move the drop in front of
your face.

15
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,680
Like an insect caught in amber, you’re
stuck.

16
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,000
Five seconds of darkness, silence, and no
way out.

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,720
Then time starts again.

18
00:00:40,827 --> 00:00:42,160
The drop falls.

19
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,400
So, what did you do with your five
seconds?

20
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:45,840
Nothing.

21
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,760
You just became five seconds older.
